        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 45.67,
          "end": 48.09,
          "en": "and also in the heal player function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48.09,
          "end": 50.11,
          "en": "because maybe we healed ourselves,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 50.11,
          "end": 52.75,
          "en": "but the monster still dealt too much damage",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 52.75,
          "end": 54.053,
          "en": "and we still died.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 54.9,
          "end": 57.82,
          "en": "So repeating the same code in all those places.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 57.82,
          "end": 60.79,
          "en": "That's not what I wanna do because repeating code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 60.79,
          "end": 61.95,
          "en": "is never good.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 61.95,
          "end": 64.39,
          "en": "If we ever decide to change something,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 64.39,
          "end": 67.27,
          "en": "we need to change it in a lot of different places.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 67.27,
          "end": 70.15,
          "en": "And therefore we wanna avoid that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 70.15,
          "end": 73.68,
          "en": "Instead with view, we have a nicer way of keeping track",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 73.68,
          "end": 78.13,
          "en": "of something than doing something in reaction to that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 78.13,
          "end": 80.163,
          "en": "We could add a watcher.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
