          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 92.97999999999999,
          "end": 94.63,
          "en": "and the monster health.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 94.63,
          "end": 97.9,
          "en": "So we add a watcher for the player health property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 97.9,
          "end": 101.41,
          "en": "And as you learned, this name is now not up to you,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 101.41,
          "end": 104.18,
          "en": "instead that has to be the name of a property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 104.18,
          "end": 107.05,
          "en": "you wanna watch and you wanna watch",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 107.05,
          "end": 108.723,
          "en": "this player health property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 110.92,
          "end": 113.32,
          "en": "And hence I'll add a second watcher,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 113.32,
          "end": 116.12299999999999,
          "en": "where I watch the monster health like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 117.95,
          "end": 120.53,
          "en": "You all learned that we get the values then",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 120.53,
          "end": 124.22,
          "en": "of those watched values whenever to watch your triggers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 124.22,
          "end": 128.07,
          "en": "And therefore let's now start in the player health watcher.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 128.07,
          "end": 131.6,
          "en": "There, we need a regular if check where we check",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 131.6,
          "end": 135.35,
          "en": "if the value, so the player health is smaller",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 135.35,
          "end": 137.41,
          "en": "or equal than zero.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 137.41,
          "end": 142.15,
          "en": "And if let's say the monster health also is smaller",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 142.15,
          "end": 143.63,
          "en": "or equal than zero.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 143.63,
