          "en": "is smaller or equal than zero.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 157.38,
          "end": 160.53,
          "en": "So the first condition is not met, but the value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 160.53,
          "end": 164.93,
          "en": "So the player health is below zero or equal to zero.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 164.93,
          "end": 167.69,
          "en": "Then we know the player lost.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 167.69,
          "end": 170.67000000000002,
