          "en": "will not be a problem.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 236.21,
          "end": 238.59,
          "en": "What do we want to do if we have a draw then,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 238.59,
