          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 429.06,
          "end": 433.64,
          "en": "If it is a string like draw or a monster or player,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 433.64,
          "end": 437.11,
          "en": "the concrete value does not matter, then this is truthy",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 437.11,
          "end": 439.403,
          "en": "and they for this section does show up.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 440.68,
          "end": 443.84,
          "en": "Now inside of the section, we also need v if",
